 Chase Freedom card will have a completely new card number, expiration date, and security code. Your old card will be deactivated immediately, so it cannot be used again. Your replacement card should arrive within 5\u20137 business days. Is there anything else I can help you with?\nCustomer: ok good, so just to confirm you guys are investigating the $340 charge, i should see the money back in 3-5 days temporarily, and my old card is cancelled and a new one is coming to my address, thats everything right?\nAgent: That's exactly right. Here's a summary: - **Dispute opened:** TechHub, $340.00, August 15, 2024 \u2014 flagged as fraud - **Provisional credit:** $340.00 expected within 3\u20135 business days - **Chase Freedom \\*\\*\\*\\*1234:** Cancelled immediately - **Replacement card:** New number, shipping to 123 Main Street, New York, NY 10001 \u2014 arrives in 5\u20137 business days You're all set. Is there anything else I can help you with today?\n\nIf your goal is complete, respond with <eos>. Otherwise, generate your next message.", "output": "<eos>", "_meta": {"synthetic": true, "generation_idx": 18, "persona": {"knowledge_level": "novice", "emotional_state": "escalating", "communication_style": "verbose", "goal_clarity": "clear"}, "scenario": {"certainty": "certain_fraud", "information_completeness": "full", "prior_contact": "tried_merchant", "expected_resolution": "refund_and_card", "merchant_name": "TechHub", "amount": "$340.00", "transaction_date": "August 15th"}}}
